---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: A2 English Course
description: Improve your confidence in speaking, grammar, and understanding with the A2 English course.
courseLevel: A2
---

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-title">A2 English Course</h1>
    <p class="page-description">Strengthen your English for longer conversations and everyday tasks</p>
    <p class="page-description" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
      Looking for free video lessons?
      <a href="https://www.ingilisdili.net/free-lessons" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Browse free lessons on ingilisdili.net</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="grammar-topics">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">A2 Lessons</h2>
    <div class="topics-grid">
      {% for lesson in a2Lessons %}
      <div class="topic-card">
        <h3 class="topic-title">{{ lesson.indexTitle }}</h3>
        <p class="topic-description">{{ lesson.indexDescription }}</p>
        <a href="/courses/a2/lesson-{{ lesson.number }}/" class="topic-link">Start Lesson {{ lesson.number }}</a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="section-footer">
      {% for lesson in a2Lessons %}
      <a href="/courses/a2/lesson-{{ lesson.number }}/" class="button{% if loop.index % 2 == 0 %} button-secondary{% endif %}">Open Lesson {{ lesson.number }}: {{ lesson.title }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="cta-title">Free English Lessons</h2>
    <p class="cta-description">
      Get extra practice with free lessons on our partner site.
      Perfect for building vocabulary, grammar, and listening skills.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a
        href="https://www.ingilisdili.net/free-lessons"
        class="button button-secondary"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Start Free Lessons
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section" style="background-color: var(--color-primary-dark);">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="cta-title">Great Work</h2>
    <p class="cta-description">Complete the A2 lessons, then check your level or explore more free practice.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/courses/" class="button button-primary">View All Courses</a>
      <a href="/placement-test/" class="button button-secondary">Take Level Test</a>
      <a
        href="https://www.ingilisdili.net/free-lessons"
        class="button button-secondary"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Explore Free Lessons
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
